                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I really loved the vibe of this place! It’s super cozy with all the plants and books everywhere, which makes it a great spot to just chill for a bit. I stuck to the coffee and it was solid, exactly what I needed.\n\nI didn\u0027t actually try any of the desserts myself this time, but my friends were obsessed with them (the cinnamon roll looked especially good). Also, a huge plus that it’s pet-friendly! I saw a few cute doggos while I was there. Definitely a nice, quiet neighborhood spot for hanging out with friends, working or studying.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
